{
  "voiceover": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 6,
      "text": "A launch needs more than a caption. It needs the work around it to move."
    },
    {
      "start": 6,
      "end": 13,
      "text": "In your company Slack, give me the job."
    },
    {
      "start": 13,
      "end": 21,
      "text": "I start with a plan: what I will look at, what I will prepare, and what I need you to decide."
    },
    {
      "start": 21,
      "end": 31,
      "text": "Then I research the business and prepare reviewable marketing work, such as a product page, announcement, walkthrough, and email."
    },
    {
      "start": 31,
      "end": 37,
      "text": "When a public change is ready, you approve it."
    },
    {
      "start": 37,
      "end": 42,
      "text": "I’m Kite, the AI marketer in Slack. Add me to your team."
    }
  ],
